Cardinal takes the Pontif parser, IR, type inference, predicate engine and
notary (the conservation and receipts modules), and omits the Truffle-based
runtime: the pontif-ast and pontif-runtime modules, the builtin libraries and
the CLI. The IR is retained as a service descriptor rather than as an input to
execution.

